{"title":"住房城乡建设部发布三项国家标准、一项行业标准","date":"2024-11-27","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">住房城乡建设部发布三项国家标准、一项行业标准<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">近日，住房城乡建设部发布三项国家标准《电力系统继电保护及自动化设备柜（屏）工程技术规范》《水工建筑物抗冰冻设计规范》《综合医院建筑设计规范》和一项行业标准《垃圾清运工职业技能标准》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">点击下方绿色标题了解标准详情。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202411/%E3%80%8A%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%9B%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%BB%A7%E7%94%B5%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8A%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%9F%9C%EF%BC%88%E5%B1%8F%EF%BC%89%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E3%80%8B.pdf\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\">《电力系统继电保护及自动化设备柜（屏）工程技术规范》</span></b></a><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">批准国家标准《电力系统继电保护及自动化设备柜（屏）工程技术规范》局部修订的条文，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。标准名称修改为《电力系统继电保护及自动化设备柜（屏）工程技术标准》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">为统一电力系统继电保护及自动化设备柜<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>屏<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>的技术管理，规范设计、安装、调试和验收要求，提高继电保护及自动化设备柜<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>屏<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>的安装、调试质量和运行水平，制定本标准<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202411/%E3%80%8A%E6%B0%B4%E5%B7%A5%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%89%A9%E6%8A%97%E5%86%B0%E5%86%BB%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E3%80%8B.pdf\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\">《水工建筑物抗冰冻设计规范》</span></b></a><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">批准国家标准《水工建筑物抗冰冻设计规范》局部修订的条文，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。标准名称修改为《水工建筑物抗冰冻设计标准》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">为了统一在冰、冻融和冻胀作用下的水工建筑物抗冰冻设计标准和技术要求，提高水工建筑物的抗冰冻耐久性能，制定本标准。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202411/%E3%80%8A%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E3%80%8B.pdf\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\">《综合医院建筑设计规范》</span></b></a><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">批准国家标准《综合医院建筑设计规范》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">GB51039-2014</span>）局部修订的条文，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。标准名称修改为《综合医院建筑设计标准》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">本标准适用于新建、改建和扩建的综合医院的建筑设计。其他医疗工程项目可参照执行。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202411/%E3%80%8A%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E6%B8%85%E8%BF%90%E5%B7%A5%E8%81%8C%E4%B8%9A%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E3%80%8B.pdf\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\">《垃圾清运工职业技能标准》</span></b></a><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif;\r\ncolor:#4EA72E;mso-themecolor:accent6\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">批准《垃圾清运工职业技能标准》为行业标准，编号为<span lang=\"EN-US\">CJJ/T323-2024</span>，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">为加强垃圾清运从业人员队伍建设，进一步规范垃圾清运工职业技能等级及培训考核工作，提升垃圾清运工业务能力，制定本标准。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}